hero=f'''<section class="hero" id="about"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-line"></span> Machine learning researcher</p><h1>Raoof<br>Zare Moayedi<span class="name-dot">.</span></h1><p class="hero-lead">Fundamental questions<br><em>in machine learning.</em></p><p class="hero-description">I’m curious about fundamental problems in machine learning. My interests range from privacy, robustness, and uncertainty quantification to reasoning, training dynamics, and scientific deep learning.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#research">View my research</a><a class="button secondary" href="cv.html">Curriculum vitae</a></div><p class="hero-affiliation">M.Sc. Computer Science <span>Sharif University of Technology</span></p></div><div class="research-art sketch-panel interest-gallery" id="interests" role="region" aria-label="Research interests"><div class="interest-header"><span>Research interests</span><span id="interest-count" aria-hidden="true">01 / 08</span></div><div class="interest-topics" role="group" aria-label="Choose a research interest">{hero_buttons}</div><div class="interest-stage"><div class="sketch-paper" id="interest-illustrations">{hero_images}</div></div><div class="interest-caption"><h2 id="interest-title">{hero_interests[0][1]}</h2><p id="art-description">{hero_interests[0][4]}</p><p class="sr-only" id="interest-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p></div></div></section>'''
